AndTheFamilyStone.lnk.to/listenYD/youtube\n\nFollow Sly & The Family Stone:\nFacebook: https://SlyAndTheFamilyStone.lnk.to/followFI\nTwitter: https://SlyAndTheFamilyStone.lnk.to/followTI\nWebsite: https://SlyAndTheFamilyStone.lnk.to/followWI\nSpotify: https://SlyAndTheFamilyStone.lnk.to/followSI\nYouTube: https://SlyAndTheFamilyStone.lnk.to/subscribeYD\n\nLyrics:\nSometimes I'm right and I can be wrong\nMy own beliefs are in my song\nThe butcher, the banker, the drummer and then\nMakes no difference what group I'm in\n\nI am everyday people, yeah, yeah\n\nThere is a blue one who can't accept the green one\nFor living with a fat one, trying to be a skinny one\nDifferent strokes for different folks\nAnd so on and so on and scooby-dooby-dooby\n\nOoh, sha-sha\nWe got to live together (Ooh, sha-sha)\n\nI am no better and neither are you\nWe are the same, whatever we do\nYou love me, you hate me, you know me and then\nYou can't figure out the bag I'm in\n\nI am everyday people, yeah, yeah\n\n\n#SlyAndTheFamilyStone #EverydayPeople #Stand", "channel_id": "UCWNw58kx3l8K9A9SUrC61Aw", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWNw58kx3l8K9A9SUrC61Aw", "duration": 144, "view_count": 14760169, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YUUhDoCx8zc", "categories": ["Music"], "tags": ["everyday people", "sly and the family stone", "everyday people sly and the family stone", "sly and the family stone everyday people", "am everyday people", "canzoni facili chitarra", "chitarra", "every day people", "sly stone", "everyday people song", "sly stone everyday people", "sly the family stone", "i'm everyday people", "accordi chitarra sly everyday people", "everyday people music video", "sly and the family stone music video", "60's hits", "Summer of Soul Soundtrack", "stand", "black lives matter"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels"